OL,3,GNEWSAStories to make you smile from
OL,4,Aacross Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery week in Yorkshire we cover
OL,7,Fuplifting and feel-good stories about
OL,8,Fpeople, places and animals across our
OL,9,Fregion - and we like to shout about
OL,10,Fthem.
OL,12,FThis week, we focus on a "big day" for
OL,13,FPokemon fans, a national award for hot
OL,14,Fsauce, and former rugby league star
OL,15,FKevin Sinfield aiming to sell thousands
OL,16,Fof pairs of socks in aid of motor
OL,17,Fneurone disease (MND) charities.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
