OL,3,GNEWSAStories to make you smile from
OL,4,Aacross Yorkshire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer rugby league star Kevin Sinfield
OL,7,Fis aiming to sell 7,777 pairs of sports
OL,8,Fsocks as part of his fundraising
OL,9,Fmission for motor neurone disease (MND)
OL,10,Fcharities.
OL,12,FThe Sock It To MND campaign has been
OL,13,Flaunched in support of his seventh and
OL,14,Ffinal challenge - dubbed 7 in 7: The
OL,15,FGrand Finale. The number pays tribute
OL,16,Fto his former Leeds Rhinos team mate
OL,17,FRob Burrow, who died in June 2024 after
OL,18,Fliving with MND for four and a half
OL,19,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
